      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oil_City%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every year, more than 50,000 people gather for the Oil Heritage Festival, celebrating the city’s role in the Industrial Revolution.",
